text @[Father]
text Yeah.
text My father's face is calm...
text He looks like a guy who's finished everything he had to finish...
text When I see that, tears begin to drip from my eyes.
text Did this man have a happy life...?
text Right at the happiest moment of his life... he lost the woman he loved...
text But even so... He kept working hard, for my sake, because she had left me behind...
text Me... An ungrateful son...
text He kept doing everything he could for a son who never showed him an ounce of gratitude...
text Was he... happy with that...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Hic... Ah...
text I begin to hiccup as I cry like a little kid.
