text I need to see him off as a strong son, not like this.
text So that he doesn't worry about me any longer...
text So that he can rest easily, finally...
text So that he can put an end to all the days he spent sacrificing everything for me...
text So that he can put an end to it...
text ......
text ...Something tugs the cuff of my pants.
text Ushio is holding onto them.
text That's right... From here on out, I'm the father now.
text I'm... not a kid anymore.
text I wipe away my tears and raise my head.
text And then I speak to him.
