sound PB8.aac
text @[Voice]
text (I've never seen him before... What could he've been doing all this time?)
sound PB9.aac
text @[Voice]
text (I hear there were all sorts of things...)
text I decide to walk up to the gathering of mothers.
text @[Tomoya]
text Um... Nice to meet you. I'm Ushio Okazaki's father.
text The mothers pull away from me a bit.
text @[Tomoya]
text I hope that Ushio... can continue to be friends with all of your children.
text @[Tomoya]
text Please.
text I bow my head.
sound PBA.aac
text @[Voice]
text O-Oh, we feel the exact same way...
text I hear a few voices reply to me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, I need to head to work.
text I turn around.
text I hear the whispers start up again.
text But no matter what they say, it doesn't bother me.
text Because it's true. I neglected my responsibilities as a father.
text But that's over with now. So I shouldn't look back... I should only look forward.
text All I can do is work hard to keep being a good father.
