text But that's exactly the time when people get hurt or mess up.
text I feel a little embarrassed. My face feels hot.
text I hadn't realized that it was even showing in my attitude.
sound PBE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I've got a real good idea of what kind of person you are, Okazaki.
sound PBF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Which is why I don't want you getting hurt for some stupid reason.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Thanks, a lot.
